Accession Number  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID REMOVED_CASE_ID Report Status  Signed Type  Surgical Pathology Procedure Date  REMOVED_DATE  DIAGNOSIS  A  Left breast  simple mastectomy  Healing excision site  no residual ductal carcinoma in situ seen  Nipple  random breast tissue  no diagnostic abnormalities recognized  B  Right breast  simple mastectomy  Nipple  no diagnostic abnormalities recognized  Random breast tissue with mild atrophy  NOTE  The previous excision report has been reviewed  St  Vincent s Hospital  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID 4061   Final Diagnosis by  Richard J  Sampson  M D  Clinical diagnosis   history  Left breast carcinoma Tissue Designation  A Breast  simple mastectomy   left B Breast  simple mastectomy   right Gross description  Specimen A labeled  left breast simple mastectomy  consists of a breast which weighs 337 grams and measures 14 x 12 x 2 cm  A mark is present on the superficial portion of the breast tissue designated 12 o clock  A triangular piece of skin is present including the nipple and areola  The skin measures 5 x 4 cm  and the areolar diameter is 3 cm  and the nipple is not inverted  At the 12 o clock edge of this piece of skin there is a well healed scar 4 cm  long  Beneath this scar is a cystic area 4 cm  in diameter next to which is areas of orange fat necrosis  Definite residual tumor is not grossly present  The cystic cavity extends to the deep fascia which is separated from the deep margin of resection by only REMOVED_DATE cm  of remaining breast tissue  Sections are taken as follows  11X  Section code  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   nipple REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   skin scar REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   deep margin REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   reactive area next to the cyst REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   random breast clockwise from the 12 o clock marker Specimen B labeled  right breast simple mastectomy  consists of a right breast which weighs 411 grams which has an ellipse of skin including the nipple which measures 5 x 3 cm  The entire breast measures 15 x 15 x 3 cm  No scars are present on the skin  Likewise  no areas of gross tumor formation are seen  A suture is present designated 12 o clock  8X  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID is the nipple and the remainder are all random breast  Multiple cut section through the breast shows a mixture of fibroglandular tissue and adipose tissue without gross lesions  Dictated by  RJS____ signature on file ____RICHARD SAMPSON  M D  REMOVED_DATE   Final   report_end , 0.
