   orange  There is a poorly defined hemorrhagic area with irregular margins  4 x REMOVED_DATE x 4 5 cm  located in the central portion of the specimen  located closest to the superior  0 1 cm   deep  0 3   and inferior  0 3  margins  and far from the medial    1 cm  and lateral    1 cm  margins  Blue ink is not well seen grossly  The lesion is firm but not hard  The lesion involves adjacent firm white rubbery breast tissue  Hemorrhage is present in adjacent adipose tissue  A hemorrhagic needle track leads into the lesion  The central portion of the lesion consists of homogeneous clotted dark blood  Representative samples are taken for the tumor bank  Lesional tissue is sent for cytogenetic analysis  The entire gross lesion is submitted for microscopic analysis  Adjacent fibrous tissue and representative margin sections are submitted  Micro 1  lesion and closest deep margin  1 frag  RSS  Micro 2  lesion and closest inferior margin  1 frag  RSS  Micro 3  lesion and closest superior margin  1 frag  RSS  Micro 4  fibrous tissue adjacent to lesion at superior and deep margins  1 frag  RSS  Micro 5  lesion and additional deep margin  1 frag  RSS  Micro 6  lesion and additional superior margin  1 frag  RSS  Micro 7  adjacent fibrous tissue at deep margin  1 frag  RSS  Micro REMOVED_DATE  remainder of lesion  mult frags  ESS  Micro REMOVED_DATE  adjacent hemorrhagic areas in adipose tissue  mult frag  ESS  Micro REMOVED_DATE  fibrous tissue away from the lesion  mult frags  RSS  Micro 18  lateral margin  mult frags  RSS  Micro 19  probable anterior margin  mult frags  RSS  Micro 20  medial margin  1 frag  RSS  Reports to  LESNIKOSKI  BETH ANN M D  SPECIMEN TYPE  BREAST MASTECTOMY   PARTIAL OR SIMPLE  report_end , 0.
