ior   comprising approximately 60  of the specimen are submitted for histologic examination  Micro REMOVED_DATE  slice 1  sectioned perpendicular to superior margin  mult frags  ESS Micro REMOVED_DATE  slice 5  3 frags  ESS Micro REMOVED_DATE  slice 6  scattered calcifications in  7   3 frags  ESS Micro REMOVED_DATE  slice 7  clustered calcifications in  10   3 frags  ESS Micro REMOVED_DATE  slice 8  3 frags  ESS Micro REMOVED_DATE  slice 9  fibrous area in  16   3 frags  ESS Micro 18  slice 12  perpendicular to inferior margin  6 frags  ESS jmh Reports to  CARTER  KATHARINE M D  SPECIMEN TYPE  BREAST   EXCISIONAL TISSUE W MARGINS  report_end , 0.
