l areas of the breast tissue  Approximately 50  of the breast tissue is fibrous  Micro REMOVED_DATE  Serial sections of breast tissue  ESS  NOTE  Sections 3 through 11 contain bisected slices of breast tissue  REMOVED_DATE  frags each ESS  ko Reports to  RHEI  ESTHER M D  SPECIMEN TYPE  BREAST   EXCISIONAL TISSUE W MARGINS  report_end , 1.
