ts the inferior resection margin  The superior resection margin is re inked in red  the inferior resection margin is re inked in yellow  and the following sections are taken  The nodule is submitted entirely in cassette A through J  cassettes A and B represent the lateral aspect of the nodule  3 5 cm from the lateral resection margin   and cassettes I and J represents the medial aspect of the nodule  3 7 cm from the medial resection margin   Sections through the lateral inferior area of fibrosis are submitted in cassettes K through M  Sections through grossly unremarkable breast parenchyma taken REMOVED_DATE cm from the medial resection margin are submitted in cassette N and O  Skin and subcutaneous tissue overlying the closest  3 2 cm  portion of the nodule is submitted as cassette P  Breast tissue at the lateral resection margin is submitted as Q  Breast tissue at the medial resection margin is submitted as R  Resident  JAMES J  TIESINGA  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SURGICAL DAY CARE   ACC 3 REPORTS TO  Leslie Wayne Ottinger  M D  PART   LEFT BREAST  report_end , 0.
