mph nodes  the largest measuring REMOVED_DATE cm in maximum dimension  Micros  12 15  Axillary lymph nodes  6 frags  RSS  Reports to  CHRISTIAN  ROGER  L  M D  SPECIMEN TYPE  LUMPECTOMY ADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE  AXILLARY NODES  report_end , 0.
