eral margin  The specimen is entirely submitted from lateral to medial margins  The white nodule marked with a stitch contains central yellow white cheesy possibly necrotic material  The remainder of the breast parenchyma consists of approximately 80  unremarkable yellow adipose tissue and 20  white fibrous tissue  There are no areas grossly suspicious for invasive carcinoma present  Micro REMOVED_DATE  breast biopsy submitted from lateral to medial margins  nodule in cassettes 9 and 10  mult frags  ESS rdo Reports to  KAELIN  CAROLYN  MARY M D  SPECIMEN TYPE  BREAST   EXCISIONAL TISSUE W MARGINS  report_end , 0.
