s 1 cm from the superficial surgical margin REMOVED_DATE cm from the deep surgical margin  9 cm from the medial surgical margin and REMOVED_DATE from the lateral surgical margin  The rest of the breast parenchyma consists of unremarkable adipose tissue  SECTION CODE  A H  biopsy site I J  medial resection margin K  lateral resection margin L  nipple M  breast parenchyma from the medial part N  breast parenchyma from the central part O Q  breast parenchyma from lateral part RandS  lymph nodes Also received separately labeled with patient s name and unit number only are multiple pieces and strips of adipose tissue and skin  The largest is triangular and measures 10 x 9 x 3 cm and covered by unremarkable skin  another is REMOVED_DATE x 4 x REMOVED_DATE cm tan yellow adipose tissue is found  The latter two pieces are inked and sectioned to reveal unremarkable fibroadipose tissue  Representative sections are submitted in T through X  Resident  Essam Ahmed  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Herbert Charles Hoover Jr   M D  James Warren May Jr   M D  PART A  LEFT BREAST and LEVEL I NODES PART B  BREAST SKIN and ABDOMINAL FLAP  report_end , 0.
